# Keep the repo LF everywhere so a Windows checkout and a Linux/container checkout produce identical bytes
# (golden images, trace checksums and `docs cannot drift` tests all hash or compare file text).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
# The ADR index is a generated table (red_engine2 adr index --write): two branches that each add a row both keep theirs
docs/adr/README.md merge=union
